NOTICE
======

This file records the copyright and licence statements carried by the imported
code under `src/deps`, and the paths each one covers.

The repository's own licence is in `LICENSE`. It reports what the files under
`src/deps` declare, as text, and draws no conclusions beyond that. Where a file
declares nothing, that is recorded rather than assumed away.

Where each tree came from, at which version, and what was pruned from it is in
`src/deps/VENDORING.md`. This file covers licensing only.

The counts and file lists below were produced by reading every tracked file
under `src/deps` as it stood when this file was added. That was 125 files.


